    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a burden is an understatement. it's just exhausting. if everything is just an accident and there's no light at the end of it, why even bother keeping up the act? why go through the effort of eating and sleeping and working just to end up in the same nothingness eventually? it feels like we're all just performing for an audience that doesn't exist. it makes me feel like the most logical thing to do is just... stop the performance.",
